{"id":"future-in-the-past","lv":"b2","n":5,"cat":"tense","t":"Was going to, would: dự định nhìn từ quá khứ","en":"I was going to call you, but… · She said she would…","sum":"Nhìn tương lai từ một mốc quá khứ. Was / were going to + V = đã định (nhưng thường không làm): I was going to call you, but my phone died. Would + V = will của quá khứ, hay đứng sau said, thought, knew, promised: You said you would be home by nine. Was about to + V = sắp sửa… thì: I was about to leave when it started to rain. Tiếng Việt: “đã định…”, “cứ tưởng sẽ…”, “vừa định… thì…”. Để nói “định mà không làm”, dùng was going to (would ở đây dễ bị hiểu là giả định).","forms":[{"f":"was / were going to + V = đã định (nhưng…)","vi":"I was going to call you, but…"},{"f":"would + V = sẽ, nhìn từ quá khứ","vi":"I knew you would like it."},{"f":"was about to + V = sắp sửa… thì","vi":"I was about to leave when it started to rain."},{"f":"said / thought / knew / promised + would","vi":"She said she would come."}],"pts":[{"id":"future-in-past","name":"Future in the past","vi":"Was going to, would: dự định / dự đoán nhìn từ quá khứ"}],"cast":{"mom":{"name":{"en":"Mom","vi":"Mẹ"},"look":"mom","x":560},"zoe":{"name":{"en":"Zoe","vi":"Zoe"},"look":"teengirl","style":{"top":"#E0607E","topShade":"#C44B68","accent":"#C44B68","hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#8B5A2B"},"x":1040}},"bg":"home-evening","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Zoe, why didn't you call me? I was worried!","vi":"Zoe, sao con không gọi cho mẹ? Mẹ lo lắm!","ipa":["ˈzoʊi","waɪ","ˈdɪdənt","ju","kɔl","mi","aɪ","wɑz","ˈwɝid"],"who":"mom","ann":{"expression":"worried"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":3.784,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,1.097],[2,1.259],[3,1.459],[4,1.559],[5,1.809],[6,2.909],[7,3.072],[8,3.284]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Sorry, Mom. I was going to call you, but my phone died.","vi":"Con xin lỗi mẹ. Con định gọi, nhưng điện thoại hết pin.","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","mɑm","aɪ","wɑz","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","kɔl","ju","bʌt","maɪ","foʊn","daɪd"],"who":"zoe","ann":{"e